The Moh page citation needs a correction in the report: printed pp.196–199 are PDF pages 57–60, but Proposition 6.1 actually begins on printed p.190 and Proposition 6.2 on p.195. Moh proves only \(\delta^*\ge1\) generally; its \(V_s/u_s\) radius bound is assumed in Proposition 6.3 and proved in Proposition 6.4 only when \(u_s=1\). The new \(u_s>1\) floor is therefore a different quantity—the final \(f_\xi\)-root order—not Moh’s combined minor-disc radius.
